@startuml LINE OAuth 2.0 Backend Callback Flow - Current Implementation
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam maxmessagesize 60

title LINE OAuth 2.0 Backend Callback Flow\nCurrent Implementation - Verified Working

actor User as U
participant "Frontend\n(App.tsx)" as FE
participant "WalletModal\n(.tsx)" as WM
participant "Backend\n(Controller)" as BE
participant "LINE Auth\nService" as SVC
participant "LINE Platform\n(OAuth)" as LINE
participant "Official Account\n(Bot)" as OA

== Page Load - Callback Detection ==
U -> FE: Access ngrok URL\nhttps://b0280d99b435.ngrok-free.app
activate FE
FE -> FE: useEffect() runs\ncheckLineCallback()
FE -> FE: Parse URL parameters\n(auth_token, auth_success, auth_error)
alt No auth parameters
    FE -> FE: logDebug("No LINE OAuth callback detected")
    FE -> U: Show normal page\n"Not connected"
end
deactivate FE

== OAuth Initiation ==
U -> FE: Click "Connect Wallet"
activate FE
FE -> WM: Show WalletModal
activate WM
U -> WM: Click "Connect with LINE"
WM -> WM: handleLineOAuth()

note over WM: LIFF context check\n(source=line parameter)

WM -> BE: GET /auth/line/nonce\nheader: ngrok-skip-browser-warning
activate BE
BE -> SVC: generateNonce()
activate SVC
SVC -> SVC: Generate random nonce (16 bytes)\nGenerate nonceId (8 bytes)
SVC -> SVC: Store in nonceStore\n(5 minute expiration)
SVC -> BE: { nonce, nonceId }
deactivate SVC
BE -> WM: { success: true, nonce, nonceId }
deactivate BE

WM -> WM: Build OAuth URL:\nhttps://access.line.me/oauth2/v2.1/authorize\n+ response_type=code\n+ client_id=2007331425\n+ redirect_uri=backend/callback\n+ state=nonceId\n+ bot_prompt=aggressive\n+ scope=profile openid\n+ nonce=nonce

WM -> U: window.location.href = authUrl
deactivate WM
deactivate FE

== LINE Platform Processing ==
U -> LINE: Redirected to LINE OAuth
activate LINE
alt User not logged in
    LINE -> U: Show LINE login screen
    U -> LINE: Enter LINE credentials
end

LINE -> U: Show consent screen\n(profile, openid permissions)
U -> LINE: Accept permissions

LINE -> OA: bot_prompt=aggressive\nShow Official Account friend prompt
activate OA
OA -> U: "Add @997kysit/dePick-OA as friend?"
U -> OA: Add as friend (required)
OA -> LINE: Friend addition confirmed
deactivate OA

LINE -> BE: GET /auth/line/callback\n?code=AUTH_CODE&state=NONCE_ID
deactivate LINE

== Backend Callback Processing ==
activate BE
BE -> BE: handleOAuthCallback()\nValidate parameters
BE -> SVC: handleOAuthCallback(code, state)
activate SVC

SVC -> SVC: Verify state parameter\n(nonceId exists & not expired)
alt Invalid/expired nonce
    SVC -> BE: throw Error("Invalid state")
    BE -> FE: Redirect with auth_error
end

SVC -> LINE: POST /oauth2/v2.1/token\n+ grant_type=authorization_code\n+ code=AUTH_CODE\n+ redirect_uri=backend/callback\n+ client_id + client_secret
activate LINE
LINE -> SVC: { access_token, id_token, ... }
deactivate LINE

SVC -> LINE: POST /oauth2/v2.1/verify\n+ id_token=ID_TOKEN\n+ client_id=2007331425\n+ nonce=STORED_NONCE
activate LINE
LINE -> SVC: Verification success
deactivate LINE

SVC -> LINE: GET /v2/profile\nAuthorization: Bearer ACCESS_TOKEN
activate LINE
LINE -> SVC: { userId, displayName, pictureUrl, ... }
deactivate LINE

SVC -> SVC: Create JWT token:\n{ provider: 'line',\n  lineId: userId,\n  displayName: displayName,\n  pictureUrl: pictureUrl,\n  verified: true,\n  authenticatedAt: timestamp }\nSign with JWT_SECRET (1h expiration)

SVC -> SVC: Cleanup nonce\n(delete from nonceStore)
SVC -> BE: { jwtToken, userData }
deactivate SVC

BE -> FE: HTTP 302 Redirect\nhttps://b0280d99b435.ngrok-free.app\n?auth_token=JWT_TOKEN\n&auth_success=true
deactivate BE

== Frontend Callback Detection ==
U -> FE: Browser follows redirect
activate FE
FE -> FE: useEffect() runs\ncheckLineCallback()
FE -> FE: Parse URL parameters:\nauth_token = JWT_TOKEN\nauth_success = "true"

FE -> FE: Decode JWT token (client-side)\nconst tokenPayload = JSON.parse(atob(authToken.split('.')[1]))

FE -> FE: Create userData object:\n{ provider: 'line',\n  lineID: tokenPayload.lineId,\n  displayName: tokenPayload.displayName,\n  pictureUrl: tokenPayload.pictureUrl,\n  verified: tokenPayload.verified,\n  token: authToken }

FE -> FE: Clean up URL\nwindow.history.replaceState({}, title, pathname)

FE -> FE: handleAuthSuccess(userData)\nsetUser(userData)\nsetShowWalletModal(false)

FE -> U: Show "Connected" status\nDisplay user info
deactivate FE

== Success State ==
note over U, FE: User is now authenticated with LINE\nOfficial Account friendship enforced\nJWT token stored in frontend state\nURL cleaned (no token exposure)

@enduml